Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:53.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《终结者：救世军》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:02:02.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（朗维尤州立监狱 2003年）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后再问吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想… 最后再和你谈一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd try… one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该呆在旧金山的 科根博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have stayed in San Francisco, Dr. Kogan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,签下这份承诺书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By signing this consent form…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.31,0:02:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的遗体会捐献给一项崇高的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be donating your body to a noble cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到救赎的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a second chance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的研究可以让你重生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}through my research, to live again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的罪行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥和两个警察 都是让我害死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother and two cops are dead because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我罪无可恕 不用给我救赎的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 快死的不止我一个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not the only one with a death sentence, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我能治好你的癌症吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm gonna cure your cancer, Serena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑的不是自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worried about myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是人类的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about the future of the human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 卖给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sell it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是死亡的滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what death tastes like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赛博坦公司 遗体捐献协议）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参与了一项崇高的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing something very noble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我罪大恶极{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧把我碎尸万段吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cut me up until there's nothing left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我虽然行过死荫的幽谷」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea, though I walk through the valley of the Shadow of Death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「也不怕遭害 因为你与我同在」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fear no evil, for thou art with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你的杖 你的竿 都安慰我」（圣经原文）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy rod and thy staff, they comfort me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后还有什么要说的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any last words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,21世纪初
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网 一种军事防务程序 自我觉醒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将人类视作威胁 决定先发制人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,核攻击的幸存者 称这一事件为「审判日」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸存者面临着新的噩梦 一场与机器的战争
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了消灭人类 天网制造了终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着战火蔓延 抵抗军领袖们愈发绝望
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人认为 有一个人可以拯救人类
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有人认为 他不过是虚假的先知
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫约翰·康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一年是 2018年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近目标 天网研发基地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先锋 我是海盗旗六号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanguard, this is Blackjack 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹飞向天网目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile inbound to Skynet target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,11秒后击中目标 危险迫近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}TTO 11 seconds. Danger close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳到达地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor is on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项任务 动作必须麻利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This mission is a quick in-and-out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部发话 搞到计算机里的情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command deems the information on those computers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的首要任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be of the highest priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 没发现敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, there's no sign of the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们都走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿太静了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's way too quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有埋伏似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost like they're waiting for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉了 干掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down, it's down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼味道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's that smell, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这个没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥尔森 发现目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olsen. Objective located.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些我们意料之外的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something else you have to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干正事儿 巴尔巴罗萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get what we came for, Barbarosa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clock's ticking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,散开 守住各个豁口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out, secure the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿一个大口子没人管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a big gap over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么对此一无所知？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't we know about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登录破解 天网终端）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大概就是指挥部要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I think this is what Command's looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破译了源代码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in their source code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.97,0:09:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人要被运往旧金山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are being taken up north to San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被用于新型终结者的研发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of R&D project for a new Terminator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,发给指挥部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send it to Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在上传 需要2分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's uploading. I need two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 后退 后退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Go back. Go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（T-800之101型终结者）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- T-800 - 新型终结者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- T-800. - A new Terminator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you said it would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 别管那个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, get your nose out of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你的事 你不是这次任务的指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your business. You're not leading this mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 放了这群可怜虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, let's cut these sorry bastards loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 咱们撤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫里科 回话 - 看那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jericho, come in. - Watch that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回话 赫里科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Jericho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 你回地面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, get your ass topside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们快回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind those men they need to answer me on the radio, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了也得吱声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 让他们回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, get those men to respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥尔森 上面出事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olsen, something's wrong up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面 回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Topside, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的飞机飞走了 我去追{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outbound enemy aircraft. I'm in pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机上有人类囚犯 快去追{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're human prisoners aboard that thing. Get after it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据传输完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data transfer complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 我们去上面找…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, we're joining you topsi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,B10 收到请回话 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo 10, Bravo 10, do you copy? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,E1呼叫B10 收到请回话 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eagle 1 to Bravo 10. Bravo 10, do you copy? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,B10 收到请回话 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo 10, Bravo 10, do you copy? Over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请表明身份 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo 10, identify. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将派人赶赴撤离点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send units to the extraction point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少幸存者 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many survivors are on-site? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回基地吗 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to base, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回基地吗 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- RTB? - Negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带我去指挥部 - 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take me to Command. - Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去指挥部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 改变航向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. Rerouting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求被驳回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request has been denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部不想透露位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command doesn't wanna give up their position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只接受无线电联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio comms only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在下面不？- 请求被驳回了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they down there? - Request has been denied, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只披露必要信息 这是最高层的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need-to-know only. That's straight from the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开舱门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You open up that ramp…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,派潜水员带我进舱 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you tell them I need divers for a log-in! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:15.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（抵抗军指挥部）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,预言中的抵抗军领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prophesized leader of the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的跳水表演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldier, you put every man and woman in this sub in jeopardy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,给舱内的所有人带来了危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your little frogman stunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱先说清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get one thing straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信什么预言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是 我一秒钟就可以改写未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when one can rewrite the future in a heartbeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.49,0:16:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你同意我说的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we on the same page?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're on the same page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, soldier…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那儿找到了什么情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did we find down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要告诉你的才会告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be briefed on a need-to-know basis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I need to know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的人都死在那儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because my men died down in that hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 找到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did we find down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到解决问题的办法了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a solution, Connor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能彻底结束战争的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can end this war once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱都知道 机器用短波发射器联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know the machines use shortwave transmitters to communicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的情报员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our intel has located{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一个隐藏在主频道下的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hidden signal under the primary channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种信号 可以直接控制那些机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It allows for direct control over the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网也是机器 和其它机器一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet's a machine, and like all machines…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也有关机键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it has an off-switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能管用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 但还没有实战测试过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it work? Yes. Have we field-tested it? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去做实战测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll test it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳和他的技术通信小组 这方面很拿手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor and his tech-comm unit have an excellent record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,带康纳上去 准备出舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Connor topside. Prepare for log-out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事做成 战争就结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, we do this right… The war is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,4天后我们开始进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We mount our offensive in four days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.59,0:18:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是信号的代码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the codes for the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 - 为什么是4天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck. - Why four days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从天网截获了一份清除名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kill list was intercepted from Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.40,0:18:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,按那名单 咱几个这周末都得死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says everyone in this room will be dead by week's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在名单上排第二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're number two on the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁排第一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who's number one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名之辈 一个平民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unknown. A civilian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫里科 回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jericho, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.71,0:19:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回话 赫里科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Jericho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟 他没回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, he didn't make it, did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是莎拉·康纳 给我儿子约翰的第28盘录音带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is tape No. 28 of Sarah Connor to my son, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最难决定的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's most difficult is trying to decide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是什么该告诉你 什么不该告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what to tell you and what not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该谈你父亲的事情吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I tell you about your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道他是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it affect your decision to send him back in time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会派他穿越时空 回到1984年来保护我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect me knowing that he is your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你遇到他时 他比你还小 才十几岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll be younger than you, only a teenager, when you meet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 想到这些真让人发疯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, a person could go crazy thinking about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你不派卡友回来 你就不会存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't send Kyle, you can never be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网便会获胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Skynet will win the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:20:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想聊聊他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（天网传输 关闭）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友孤身一人躲在外面 天网在找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle is out there somewhere alone, and Skynet is hunting him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the signal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:20.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（天网传输 关闭）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果成功 那就太棒了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If it works, it's incredible. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.14,0:21:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得小心点 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to be careful. - I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但必须一试 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we have to try. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.24,0:21:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么从小的熟悉的东西 开始试验吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, then start with something small that we're familiar with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓个机器水栖吧 拿它试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should capture a Hydrobot, bring it in for testing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.13,0:21:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了卡友 就能改变未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Kyle Reese, reset the future…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有我的存在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.95,0:22:20.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（红小丑玩具公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想活命就跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me if you want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.12,0:24:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.82,0:24:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会说话 但你得开口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't talk, but you need to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,外套从哪儿搞到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that jacket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.29,0:24:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个家伙不需要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other guy didn't need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.19,0:24:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这红色没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that red?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.86,0:24:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这代表鲜血 是抵抗军的标志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stands for blood. It's a symbol of the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你显然不是抵抗军 所以给我脱下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're obviously not a Resistance fighter, so take it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿枪对着人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You point a gun at someone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.14,0:24:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得随时准备扣扳机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd better be ready to pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.78,0:24:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再问你一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna ask you one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.52,0:25:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那到底是什么玩意 - 终结者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell was that thing? - Terminator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.45,0:25:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,T-600型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-600.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是几号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What day is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.70,0:25:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,2018年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}2018.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.07,0:25:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.31,0:25:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判日发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judgment Day happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.15,0:25:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.35,0:25:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走路可不行 机器会打死你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go on foot. The machines will cut you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.59,0:25:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.55,0:25:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.92,0:25:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里菲思天文台附近有车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, there's some by Griffith Observatory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.06,0:25:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但开不动了 - 带我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They don't run though. - Take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是猎杀者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a Hunter-Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把它们引来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you, they know we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.97,0:26:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么 小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.60,0:26:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.05,0:26:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉了它的发射器 它没法和同伙通话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burned out his transmitter so it can't talk to any of its pals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.58,0:26:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还能接收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can still receive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.99,0:26:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把信号打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁住了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.29,0:26:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁住 摁住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it down, hold it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把信号开大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the signal up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.74,0:27:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把带子给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the strap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.81,0:27:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我靠 - 奇迹啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy shit. - Can't you believe it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.08,0:27:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 绑紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Strap it tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.83,0:27:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号必须连贯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal has to be continuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.57,0:27:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有中断…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's any interruption…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:18.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（连接天网 搜索）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶做一个便携短波发射器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's rig up a portable shortwave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去实战测试更大的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to test it on something larger in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.32,0:27:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.48,0:27:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,车在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are the cars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.98,0:27:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑了可别出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna go out after dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.22,0:27:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀者有红外眼 夜里看得更清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunter-Killers have infrared, hunt better at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.62,0:27:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱明早再出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll all go tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:28:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 两天大的狼崽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - Two-day-old coyote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.47,0:28:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,比三天大的好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than three-day-old coyote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夺枪 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.02,0:28:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.53,0:28:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.04,0:28:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 学会了？- 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.21,0:28:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,收音机能用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this radio work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.92,0:28:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸试着修过 但一直没修好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad tried to fix it, but he could never get it to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.91,0:29:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.82,0:29:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.92,0:29:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.42,0:29:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们怎么没走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you still here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.99,0:29:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是抵抗军 洛杉矶分部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're the Resistance, L.A. branch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.09,0:29:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到司令部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.43,0:29:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resisting what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.33,0:29:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器 天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machines. Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.67,0:29:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就你俩？- 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just the two of you? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.80,0:29:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么没有抵抗军标志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you're not wearing one of these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.01,0:29:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有赢得这个资格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I haven't earned mine yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.62,0:30:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他能听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope he's listening to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.63,0:30:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过长时间的艰苦战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been fighting a long time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.46,0:30:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都付出了很大代价 失去了很多亲人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have all lost so very much, so many loved ones gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.13,0:30:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你并不孤单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.17,0:30:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各地都有抵抗军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are pockets of Resistance all around the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.60,0:30:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是存亡攸关的时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at the brink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.94,0:30:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看魔术吗 拿着那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna see a magic trick? Hold that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.05,0:30:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁下按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press the button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.75,0:30:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们主武器的有效射程不足100米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective range of their main weapon is less than 100 meters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们携带大量弹药 但T-600笨重缓慢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pack a lot of firepower, but the T-600s are heavy and slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是初级产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are a primitive design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.66,0:30:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.62,0:30:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被迫与它们近身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't outrun them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 我教你一种办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - then you have one option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的运动皮质 有一部分暴露在后颈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their motor cortex is partially exposed at the back of their neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.04,0:30:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,用刀扎进去 会使其追踪装置失灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A knife to this area will disorient their tracking device, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.27,0:30:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但时间不会长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.08,0:30:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的 是活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above all, stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.53,0:31:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how important you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.53,0:31:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来会有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how important you will become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.75,0:31:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器的升级速度 比我以前说过的还要快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines are advancing even faster than I told you they would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.25,0:31:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亲眼所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在研制新的终结者 新的杀人武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're inventing new Terminators, new ways of killing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.23,0:31:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网酝酿着重大举措{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet is planning something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.36,0:31:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但抵抗军会有更大的举措{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Resistance is planning something bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.37,0:31:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.17,0:31:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在听 你就是抵抗军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're listening to this, you are the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.01,0:31:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.51,0:31:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.25,0:32:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,修好了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… you get it working?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.45,0:32:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快了 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Almost. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.06,0:32:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱是向东去 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I figure we head east, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.12,0:32:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过沙漠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go through the desert, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.23,0:32:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能与抵抗军会合了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we can connect with the Resistance there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.59,0:32:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去北边 - 不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm heading north. - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.83,0:32:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个北部地区 直到旧金山 都被机器控制了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines control the whole northern sector, up to San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.40,0:32:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天网中心在那儿 - 我得去找个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's Skynet Central. - I have to find someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.84,0:32:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你对天网了解太少了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot you don't understand about Skynet, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.81,0:32:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just too dangerous for us to go there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.08,0:32:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是洛杉矶分部嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the L.A. branch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.08,0:32:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 咱们真的必须离开洛杉矶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. We need to get out of L.A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.21,0:33:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.95,0:33:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥以前总听的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something my brother used to listen to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star, get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.82,0:33:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么看着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me like that, Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.56,0:33:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来 下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out. Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.23,0:33:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要走？你要丢下我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're leaving? You're gonna leave us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.57,0:33:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.87,0:33:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我们和机器的区别吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know the difference between us and the machines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们埋葬死去的同伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bury our dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.52,0:33:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人会去埋你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one is coming to bury you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.03,0:34:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aerostat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.50,0:34:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 终结者的侦察机 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a scout for the Terminators. - Go, drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,被间谍机听到音乐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aerostats heard the music!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.58,0:34:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开稳点 - 我从没开过车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep it steady! - I've never driven before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.95,0:34:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来握住方向盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the wheel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.50,0:34:33.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（身份确认 卡友·里斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.19,0:34:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意真烦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's pissing me off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.97,0:34:40.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡友·里斯 资料上传）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.20,0:34:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.94,0:34:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓牢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果咱想活下去 我来开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the idea is to stay alive, I'm driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.66,0:35:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人在洛杉矶动作很大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're seeing a lot of enemy movement in L.A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.67,0:35:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有我们的人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of our people in the area?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.64,0:35:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有地面部队 空中有两架A-10{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one on the ground. Two A-10s in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.10,0:35:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉姆斯和默尔哈迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Williams and Mihradi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.16,0:35:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让战机过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the birds in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.94,0:35:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那儿的人带到安全区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guide them to a safe area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.98,0:35:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 郊狼67明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Coyote 67 copies all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.79,0:35:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在飞向坐标LA1257903 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inbound to grid Lima-Alpha 1257903. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.65,0:35:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 野鹰收到 完全明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy that. - Roger, Wild Eagle. Solid copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.81,0:36:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这儿有人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there's someone here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.48,0:36:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down, get down! Get down. Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.09,0:36:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 举起手来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon! Let me see your hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.32,0:36:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动 放下武器 放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. That's it, drop it. Put it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.37,0:36:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我们看到了你们的抵抗军标志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a problem? - Hey, we saw your Resistance sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.40,0:36:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老太婆摆上的 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old lady put it there, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:36:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们来干嘛 - 我们需要燃料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - We're looking for fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.07,0:37:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗季要到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dark season's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.44,0:37:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只够自己用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only got enough for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.78,0:37:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿枪对着人 你得随时准备扣扳机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You point that gun at somebody, you'd better be ready to pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都把枪给我放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns down, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.62,0:37:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来找抵抗军的 仅此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we just came to find the Resistance, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.42,0:37:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.13,0:37:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑话 跟那些机器根本没得打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a joke. Fighting those machines is impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.10,0:37:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们老老实实的 他们就不理我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep our heads down, they ignore us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了 它们最终还是会来抓你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your heads down and they'll come for you eventually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.53,0:37:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要是帮你们 才会被抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We help you, maybe they will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.70,0:37:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人不会帮咱们 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people aren't going to help you. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.47,0:37:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.74,0:37:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让这孩子吃点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until this one gets something to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.05,0:37:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿一篮子来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me a basket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.60,0:38:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管吃 都吃光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Help yourself. Eat up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.01,0:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.91,0:38:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.51,0:38:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的燃料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.89,0:38:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能做这个主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your choice to make!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.85,0:38:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.22,0:38:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.72,0:38:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 星星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star. Star. Star! Star!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.99,0:39:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 是你们把它们引来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! You brought them here! You brought them here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop, stop! - Come on, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.27,0:39:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车 别理他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Forget them! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.24,0:39:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.85,0:39:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去隧道那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tunnels! Head for the tunnels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.20,0:39:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus. Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.24,0:39:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么跑 跑不掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just run for it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.78,0:39:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.82,0:40:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.89,0:40:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.60,0:40:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.40,0:40:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.10,0:41:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.49,0:41:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩托终结者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moto-Terminators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.90,0:41:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,打它个狗杂种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot that son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.11,0:42:09.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（躲避障碍物 主路线遇阻 刹车 分析替代路线）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.72,0:42:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯 向右拐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus, turn right up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.04,0:42:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.68,0:42:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个跑哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the other one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.13,0:43:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.37,0:43:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.44,0:43:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 把枪给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star, give me the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.74,0:43:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.09,0:43:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.97,0:43:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把铁球放下去 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop the ball! - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.21,0:44:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 抓牢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star, hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.99,0:44:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 星星 星星 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Star! Star! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.89,0:45:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡友 - 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kyle! - Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.86,0:45:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.17,0:45:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus! Marcus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.44,0:45:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现两架敌机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got eyes on two targets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.34,0:45:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,270度方位发现两架敌机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got two bogeys at 270 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.05,0:45:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从未进到这么深 肯定是在找什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've never come this deep before. They're looking for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,击落猎杀者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.K. is down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.64,0:45:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,六点钟方向有猎杀者追击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got an H.K. pushing our six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.58,0:45:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备撤 - 正在努力摆脱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abort run. - Breaking off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.82,0:46:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,规避动作 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evasive maneuvers, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.99,0:46:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被击中 左翼受损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking fire. I'm hit. Port-side damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.27,0:46:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它锁定你了 快摆脱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a lock on you. Break off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.31,0:46:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳伞 威廉姆斯 - 启动弹射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eject, Williams, eject! - Punching out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.03,0:46:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯运输机向西北飞去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoner transport, headed northwest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.80,0:46:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,方位289 旧金山方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bearing 2-8-9 towards San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.67,0:46:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试下信号吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's test the signal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.44,0:47:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.73,0:47:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.53,0:48:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的刀给我 左脚靴子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my knife. It's in my left boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.77,0:48:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.51,0:48:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱尔·威廉姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blair Williams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.11,0:48:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.95,0:48:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,教名是马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.12,0:48:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把我放下了 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can let me down now, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.73,0:48:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那玩意去哪儿了 - 那架运输机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That thing, where'd it go? - The transport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.16,0:48:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.57,0:48:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪儿 - 去追它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell are you going? - After it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.91,0:48:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我打击你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate to break it to you but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.38,0:48:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你朋友在那运输机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've got friends on that thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.39,0:48:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必死无疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're good as dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.02,0:48:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是去追它 你也活不成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same with you if you keep walking in that direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.81,0:48:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就死了 习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well I've been dead a while and I'm getting used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.82,0:48:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我回基地吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come with me to my base?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.95,0:48:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳也许有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor might know a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.43,0:49:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你对机器有怨念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you've got a problem with the machines, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.99,0:49:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他谈谈准没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's definitely the guy you wanna talk to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.43,0:49:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 基地离这儿多远？- 走路一两天吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far is your base? - It should be 1 or 2 days hike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.30,0:49:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.88,0:49:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要相信我 我们不会死的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.22,0:49:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会死的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.63,0:49:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说什么呢 讲英语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying? Speak English!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.13,0:49:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在告诉他 机器不会杀我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was telling him it is not true about the machines killing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.31,0:49:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了 它们会把我们全杀光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill us. They're gonna kill everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.34,0:49:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就是一群牲口 正被运往屠宰场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in a cattle cart, on our way to the slaughterhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.05,0:49:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 这样没好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. You're not helping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.85,0:50:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最重要的 是活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most important thing that we can do right now is stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.55,0:50:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,用脑子 用心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here and in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.36,0:50:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗 活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright? Just stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.87,0:50:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.25,0:50:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找东西生火 明天就能到基地了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find something we can burn. We'll be at my base tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.19,0:50:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.59,0:50:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.90,0:51:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you got there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.64,0:52:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些抗生素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some antibiotics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.01,0:52:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头抗生素很难找啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antibiotics are hard to come by these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.28,0:52:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿不多 但你想要的话 都拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I don't have much, but you're welcome to whatever you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.45,0:52:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直盯着你呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.95,0:52:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,找这个呐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.19,0:52:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计们 机器才是敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys. The machines are the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.29,0:52:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是朋友 - 不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're on the same side. - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.96,0:52:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿有几个朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I've got a couple of friends on my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.53,0:52:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我把你打趴下 他们可以背你回家呵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they can carry you home when I'm done with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.67,0:52:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好像没上子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to chamber a round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.28,0:52:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到一个肥臀妞儿 等了很久啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We done caught us a donkey! Been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.23,0:53:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,里克特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.52,0:53:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我也打不赢战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing me ain't gonna win this war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.23,0:54:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在想你的过去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about your past?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.11,0:54:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我明白了一个什么道理吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I've learned, Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.28,0:54:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么 你为已逝的过去叹息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is you can focus on what is lost…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.49,0:54:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么 你为眼前的现实奋斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or you can fight for what is left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.34,0:54:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.18,0:54:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.85,0:55:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想要点体温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want some body heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.19,0:55:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心跳好有力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a strong heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.53,0:55:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太喜欢这声音了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I love that sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.54,0:55:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you… for saving me back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.71,0:55:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头好人不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't meet a lot of good guys these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.38,0:55:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a good guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.56,0:55:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.06,0:55:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是还没意识到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.47,0:55:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得 人应该得到救赎的机会吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think people deserve a second chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.75,0:56:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 应该{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.99,0:56:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这儿了 天网的死亡之谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. Skynet's valley of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.76,0:56:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱从没进过这么深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never been this deep before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.99,0:56:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,得在它们的地盘 找个更大的机器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta be sure the signal works in their territory…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.06,0:56:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试一下才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the bigger machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.27,0:56:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会把它们引来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll bring them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.22,0:56:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀者 来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.K. incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.81,0:57:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,开大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.84,0:57:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 信号管用 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works, man. The signal works. It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.29,0:57:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通了阿什当司令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Ashdown's on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.62,0:57:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 成功没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, tell me it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.29,0:57:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 信号确实管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works. That is affirmative. The signal works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.33,0:58:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 明晨4点 在全球展开进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. The attack commences tomorrow at 0400, worldwide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.36,0:58:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的部队去协助轰炸天网中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your unit will be in support of the bombing of Skynet Central.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.03,0:58:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么营救那些囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the extraction plan for the prisoners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.54,0:58:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救囚犯？根本没有营救计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraction plan? There is no extraction plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.87,0:58:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只管把那儿炸平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna level the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.64,0:58:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我说过了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. I told you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.22,0:58:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网中心关押着大批人类囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet Central is filled with human prisoners!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.18,0:58:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is war, Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.52,0:58:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,领袖应该懂得牺牲 你应该最清楚这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leadership has its costs. You, above all, should know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.36,0:58:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什当 回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashdown, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.69,0:58:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什当 我是康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashdown, Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.73,0:58:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什当 回… 这孙子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashdown, come… Damn him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.48,0:58:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 退后 退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star! Get back! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.35,0:58:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得赶快冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to calm down now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.24,0:59:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这儿 我要离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get out! I gotta get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.69,0:59:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.02,0:59:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.23,0:59:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的磁铁地雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is us. The mines are magnetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.63,0:59:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这个入口直奔西走 就不会有事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we head due west at this point of entry, we're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.20,0:59:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.77,1:00:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 马库斯 我都饿死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Marcus. I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.01,1:00:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「因为你与我同在」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thou art with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.11,1:00:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你的杖 你的竿 都安慰我」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy rod and thy staff, they comfort me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.75,1:00:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.35,1:00:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是美好未来的开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the beginning of something wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这混蛋真沉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.13,1:00:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么情况 - 他踩上地雷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What've we got here? - He stepped on a land mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.87,1:00:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大口径静脉注射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start a large-bore IV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.87,1:00:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持开放 加大吗啡剂量 - 我挺得住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep it open. More morphine. - I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.87,1:00:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫什么 - 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's his name? - Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.51,1:01:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有假肢？- 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got a prosthetic limb? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.28,1:01:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉搏正常 看看都伤哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, pulse is good. Let's see what we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.05,1:01:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.89,1:01:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们技术进步真快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil's hands have been busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.56,1:01:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.13,1:01:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,血肉都是人类的 但愈合速度很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real flesh and blood, though it seems to heal itself quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏是人类的 非常强健{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart is human and very powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.97,1:01:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子也是人类的 但有个芯片接口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brain too, but with a chip interface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.31,1:01:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们把我怎么样了 - 它有一套混和神经系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you done to me? - It has a hybrid nervous system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.98,1:01:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,既有人类皮质 也有机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One human cortex, one machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.08,1:01:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱尔 他们干了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blair, what have they done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.05,1:01:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁制造的你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who built you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.59,1:01:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫马库斯·赖特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Marcus Wright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.09,1:01:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为自己是人类？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.26,1:01:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.46,1:02:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.73,1:02:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.47,1:02:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在哪儿生产的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you manufactured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.20,1:02:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出生于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.90,1:02:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,1975年8月22号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}August 22nd, 1975.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.32,1:02:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.05,1:02:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在广播里听过你的讲话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your voice on the radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.99,1:02:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是约翰·康纳 - 你当然知道我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're John Connor. - Of course you know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.00,1:03:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被派来杀我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sent here to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.00,1:03:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺杀领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.13,1:03:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听不懂你在说什么 - 那你来这儿干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what you're talking about. - Then why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.34,1:03:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱尔说 你能帮我找到一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blair said you could help me find who I'm looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.64,1:03:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.92,1:03:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把你放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let you down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.42,1:03:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把我们都干掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll kill everyone in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.85,1:03:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只杀你 康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you, Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.53,1:03:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我实在不鸟你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I ain't give a shit about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.52,1:03:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两天前才知道有你这么个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know your name until two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.69,1:03:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.96,1:03:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.53,1:03:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到这个世界之前 就开始较量了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been at war since before either of us even existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.81,1:03:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你企图杀害我的母亲 莎拉·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried killing my mother, Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.48,1:03:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的父亲 卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my father, Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.71,1:03:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你杀不了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.45,1:04:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯在运输机上 正被押送至天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese is on a transporter, heading for Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.22,1:04:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想杀他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to kill him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.89,1:04:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洛杉矶就动手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done him in L.A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.24,1:04:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿碰到那家伙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.00,1:04:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派我和默尔哈迪去护送百姓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent Mihradi and me to provide cover for some civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.07,1:04:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是其中之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.27,1:04:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有一个十几岁孩子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a teenage boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.64,1:04:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个真不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I honestly don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.89,1:04:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们把百姓押上运输机 他是唯一一个逃脱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were taken into a transport. He was the only one left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.26,1:04:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「他」 是「它」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not "he, " Blair: "It."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.25,1:04:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「它」是唯一一个逃脱的 别傻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the only one left. Don't be naive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.09,1:04:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「它」救了我的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.26,1:04:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特 会怎么处置他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate, what's gonna happen to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.26,1:04:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,肢解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disassembled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.50,1:04:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说要杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.88,1:04:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从它身上 也许可以找到天网的情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may have information on Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.34,1:04:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's not the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.35,1:04:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是敌人向我开枪 不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been shot at by the enemy. That's not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.04,1:04:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那机器救你 是为了混进来把我们都干掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That machine saved you only to gain access to kill all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.00,1:05:34.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡友·里斯 身份确认）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.65,1:05:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有事 别怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be okay. Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.26,1:05:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.74,1:06:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.12,1:06:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳要见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor wants to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.22,1:06:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.29,1:06:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会告诉我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he's gonna tell me, Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.96,1:06:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.90,1:06:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我告诉康纳你不想去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to tell Connor you're not coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.10,1:06:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.81,1:06:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.01,1:07:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把知道的都告诉你了 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you everything I know, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.84,1:07:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网冷酷无情 诡计多端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet is ruthless and unpredictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.98,1:07:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会令你以己之矛攻己之盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will use the best part of you against yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.31,1:07:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们还会有一些我无法想象的招数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will have methods I can't imagine or predict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.25,1:07:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我真的帮不了你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can't help you with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.85,1:07:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你陷入茫然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're unsure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.31,1:07:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随自己的心吧 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well just always follow your heart, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.12,1:07:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.20,1:07:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,录音带里没提到带器官的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing on the tapes about machines with organs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.00,1:07:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing in there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.47,1:07:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我了解敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I knew our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.71,1:07:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那家伙 让我觉得自己一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that thing, that makes me feel like I know nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.61,1:07:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从它的眼神看出…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked in its eyes, and it believes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.35,1:07:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真的深信自己是人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}absolutely believes, that it is human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.49,1:08:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真的认为 自己每句话都是实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It believes everything that it says, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.99,1:08:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is telling me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.23,1:08:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友就在天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Kyle Reese is in Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.83,1:08:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是这样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is true…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.23,1:08:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部将炸死我父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Command is about to bomb my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.91,1:08:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及其他囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rest of those prisoners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.99,1:08:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I cannot stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.51,1:08:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.21,1:08:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.85,1:08:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 布莱尔说你叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up? Blair said you needed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.21,1:08:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.08,1:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.69,1:09:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴恩斯 布莱尔也在下面呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnes. What about Blair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.96,1:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她咎由自取{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made her choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.04,1:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.70,1:09:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.08,1:09:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,探照灯 那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some light out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.44,1:09:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,又回地雷阵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back in the minefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.25,1:09:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我计划好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.24,1:09:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 - 他们正在逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's run! - There they go, they're on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.95,1:10:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blair, you okay? - Yeah, I'm okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.91,1:10:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看不到了 - 在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't see back! - There they are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.18,1:10:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.93,1:10:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.89,1:10:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划 就截止到那辆吉普{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-My plan stopped at the jeep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.17,1:10:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,狙击一组 打得到他们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sniper Team 1, do you have a shot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.78,1:10:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吸引火力 你把灯打灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll draw the fire. You take out the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.69,1:10:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the target!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.00,1:10:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在墙后面 - 不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Behind the wall. - Don't move. Do not move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.23,1:10:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 低头 低头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Now! Keep your head down! Keep your head down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.40,1:11:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快快快 - 快快快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.24,1:11:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go, keep running!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.84,1:11:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住 挺住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.32,1:11:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 赶紧逃出这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You alright? - Let's get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.86,1:11:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.01,1:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上 不许动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on the ground! Stay on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.78,1:11:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快下来 我过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come on straight down. I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.79,1:11:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不许动 - 看住他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do not move! - Keep your eye on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.76,1:11:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他翻过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flip him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁鳄 我是疤面人51 发现机器行踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron Gator, this is Scarface 51. We have eyes on the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.50,1:12:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,火力打击开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact initiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.02,1:12:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来架机枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.99,1:13:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,查看水面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.57,1:13:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现他了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.26,1:14:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没液压了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydraulics are out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.00,1:14:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.84,1:14:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我 把手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand! Give me your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.23,1:15:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己是什么 但大家都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what you are, even if you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.32,1:15:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.17,1:15:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那枪管个屁用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gun ain't gonna stop shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.66,1:15:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是打中你心脏呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody shot you in the heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.29,1:15:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那就是普通的人类心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I see that thing beating a mile a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.17,1:15:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.17,1:15:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在天网 你杀了我 他也活不成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Skynet. You do that, he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.68,1:15:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能带你进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.85,1:15:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.52,1:15:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.86,1:15:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我无法信任你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I don't trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.03,1:15:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是你唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only hope you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.10,1:16:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是谁把我变成这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to find who did this to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.37,1:16:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.77,1:16:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.65,1:16:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.89,1:16:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.22,1:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且告诉我卡友·里斯在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me where I can find Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.33,1:16:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.23,1:16:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.57,1:16:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个联系我 让我知道他还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact me on that. Let me know he's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.05,1:16:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.15,1:16:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.59,1:17:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.07,1:17:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.27,1:17:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.27,1:17:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.51,1:17:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.45,1:17:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的 是一个活生生的人 不是机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a man… not a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.46,1:17:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that leg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.20,1:17:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,死不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.91,1:17:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.64,1:17:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 指挥部找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor? Command for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.71,1:17:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是康纳 - 你的部队准备好没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Connor. - Connor, are your men ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.42,1:17:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大家都没准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. Nobody is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.65,1:17:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有 你们也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not, you are not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.37,1:18:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须放弃进攻计划 情况变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must abort the attack. The game has changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.66,1:18:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.86,1:18:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,部队都已经就位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All elements are past their release points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.23,1:18:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经进入攻击位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are in assault position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.00,1:18:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那至少要推迟进攻 至少要推迟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then delay the attack. At least, delay the attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.14,1:18:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有机会潜入天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a chance to infiltrate Skynet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.07,1:18:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救那些囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rescue those prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.66,1:18:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我这个机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.77,1:18:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不行 根本没有营救计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, absolutely not! This is not the time for a rescue mission!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.51,1:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的要求 会破坏整个行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you ask for, will undermine the whole operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.18,1:18:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯关在天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet has Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.35,1:18:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是他的命运 - 不 他事关人类的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then that is his fate. - No, it's our fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.02,1:18:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须救他 他是关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to save him. He is the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.02,1:18:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对未来和过去 都是关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to the future, to the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.51,1:18:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他 我们会一败涂地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without him, we lose everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.33,1:18:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你给我按原计划执行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You stay the course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.29,1:18:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果按原计划执行 我们就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stay the course, we are dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.11,1:18:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.80,1:18:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我宣布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of this moment, soldier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.77,1:18:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除你的指挥权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are relieved of your command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.70,1:18:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被抵抗军开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer a part of this Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.28,1:18:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听懂他最后一句{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't catch that last statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.78,1:19:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没听懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither did I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.49,1:19:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.95,1:19:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在听 你就是抵抗军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're listening to this, you are the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.06,1:19:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细听好 如果今晚发起进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully. If we attack tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.83,1:19:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就失去了人性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our humanity is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.56,1:19:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾认识一个女人 她告诫人们警惕未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once knew a woman who told people to fear the future…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.64,1:19:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她提醒人们 世界末日将至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the end was coming, that all would be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.91,1:19:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人相信她 她被关了起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wanted to hear her truths. Society locked her away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.48,1:19:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女人名叫莎拉·康纳 我的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman was Sarah Connor, my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.18,1:19:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们都知道 她的预言全部成真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know that what she predicted has all come to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.75,1:19:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部要我们像机器那样战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command wants us to fight like machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.86,1:19:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求我们冷血地 程式般地行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to make cold, calculated decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.09,1:19:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不是机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are not machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.89,1:19:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们沦为机器一般{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we behave like them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.85,1:19:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么赢得战争 又有什么意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what is the point… in winning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.83,1:19:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部会要求你们发起进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command is going to ask you to attack Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.87,1:20:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我请求你们不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am asking you not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.74,1:20:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮前 哪怕有一颗炸弹落在天网中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If even one bomb drops on Skynet before sunrise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.62,1:20:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就失去了未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our future will be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.72,1:20:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恳请大家停止行动 请给我时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So please, stand down. Give me the time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.59,1:20:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去捍卫我们为之战斗的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect our future, that all of us, are fighting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.10,1:20:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.09,1:20:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的人发现你走了 我该怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I tell your men when they find out you're gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.46,1:20:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.75,1:21:57.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（破解 回到出发点）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.76,1:22:11.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（天网控制区 北门）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.06,1:22:28.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（入口安检）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.99,1:22:32.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（分析 马库斯·赖特 工作状态 允许进入）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.28,1:22:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.93,1:23:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.62,1:23:40.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等待信号）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.56,1:23:51.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马库斯·赖特 身份确认）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.88,1:23:53.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等待资格认证）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.35,1:24:14.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（同步完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.77,1:24:30.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北区炮塔关闭 武装解除）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:40.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（4a监室 卡友·里斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.86,1:24:46.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（传送方位）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.70,1:24:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.51,1:25:03.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杀人犯向科学事业捐献遗体）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.42,1:25:09.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科根博士因癌症去世）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.34,1:25:11.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赛博坦公司继续致力于 科根博士未竟的自动化研究）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.78,1:25:13.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国空军收购赛博坦系统）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.82,1:25:20.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（天网启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.85,1:25:59.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（解锁）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.23,1:26:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号正以最大功率播放 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal broadcasting at full strength, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.83,1:26:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 开始轰炸天网中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Commence bombing of Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.74,1:26:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部下令开始进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a green light for the attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.81,1:26:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是贝克斯菲尔德 拒绝执行此项命令 完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Bakersfield. That's a no-go on your last. Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.51,1:26:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金停止行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, standing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.28,1:26:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雷诺 拒绝此项命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Reno. Negative on your last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.84,1:26:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 雷诺 贝克斯菲尔德 都拒绝执行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, Reno, Bakersfield. They're all standing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.98,1:26:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非康纳下令 否则他们不会进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will not attack unless Connor gives the order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.53,1:27:02.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（牢门已锁）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.51,1:27:13.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（牢门解锁）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.01,1:27:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.88,1:27:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上运输机 卡友·里斯在吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the transport! Go! Is Kyle Reese here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.07,1:27:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home. Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.34,1:27:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew you'd be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.38,1:27:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 这是程序对你的指引{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, it was programmed in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.15,1:27:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你对程序的执行 非常漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you executed that programming beautifully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.72,1:27:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.55,1:28:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是渗入型间谍机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an infiltration prototype, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.76,1:28:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是独一无二的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only one of your kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.09,1:28:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们使你复活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We resurrected you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.65,1:28:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛博坦公司的超前技术 使你更先进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advanced Cyberdyne's work… amended it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.11,1:28:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.53,1:28:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析结果显示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calculations confirmed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.14,1:28:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,科根博士的脸 最便于你的处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serena Kogan's face is the easiest for you to process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.84,1:28:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你乐意的话 还可显示其它面孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be others if you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.41,1:28:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.70,1:28:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了机器 你还能是什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else could you be… if not machine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.95,1:28:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.05,1:28:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再符合作为人类的条件了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human condition no longer applies to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.52,1:28:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受现实吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accept what you already know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.89,1:28:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造你 是为了一个目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were made to serve a purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.42,1:28:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去完成其它机器从未完成过的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To achieve what no another machine has achieved before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.19,1:28:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,渗入敌营 找到目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To infiltrate, find a target, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.60,1:28:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把他带给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then bring that target back home to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.90,1:28:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到这个世界之前 就开始较量了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been at war since before either of us even existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.21,1:28:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你企图杀害我的母亲 莎拉·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried killing my mother, Sarah Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.91,1:28:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.41,1:29:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且告诉我卡友·里斯在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me where I can find Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.95,1:29:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吗 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.49,1:29:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯 卡友·里斯 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese! Kyle Reese! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.29,1:29:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.60,1:29:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上运输机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to your transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.60,1:29:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle Reese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.02,1:29:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.61,1:29:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.91,1:29:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人类开始铤而走险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In times of desperation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.43,1:29:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会把理想误当成现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}people will believe what they want to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.36,1:29:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 我们就把理想呈现给他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, we gave them what they wanted to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.62,1:29:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们设计了那个信号的圈套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trick, in the form of a signal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.65,1:29:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军以为可以藉此结束战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Resistance thought would win the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.84,1:29:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没错 战争的确会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they were right, it will end this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.99,1:29:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过 被终结的将是抵抗军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that it is the Resistance that will be terminated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.63,1:29:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not Skynet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.94,1:29:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新启动对天网中心的进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the attack on Skynet Central back online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.94,1:30:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令空军立刻出动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want our aircraft in the sky, immediately!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.87,1:30:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 雷达发现大型飞行物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sir, we got a bogey with a very large radar signature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.14,1:30:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,正向我们逼近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}closing in on our position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.79,1:30:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛森科将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losenko?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.21,1:30:20.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（船体被锁定）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.63,1:30:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们玩了一场自我毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have destroyed ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.37,1:30:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网跟踪了我们的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet tracked our signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.21,1:30:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们自己把它们引来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We led them straight to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.35,1:30:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最精尖的机器 也一次次失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best machines have failed time and again to complete the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.22,1:30:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们工作不够周密 我们痛定思变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something was missing. We had to think, radically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.23,1:30:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们制造了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so we made you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.01,1:30:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是完美的渗入型间谍机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We created the perfect infiltration machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.56,1:30:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.27,1:31:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完成了天网多年不曾完成的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what Skynet has failed to do for so many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.94,1:31:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.30,1:32:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.51,1:32:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要反抗 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fight, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.02,1:32:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住你的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.85,1:32:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道自己的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.83,1:32:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是这样好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.50,1:32:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会给你救赎的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not be given a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.61,1:32:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot save John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.25,1:32:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.54,1:33:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳传来讯息了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a message from Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.64,1:33:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在天网 需要空中支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Skynet. Needs air support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.91,1:33:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 紧急起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Scramble aircraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.75,1:33:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star! Star, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.73,1:33:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.06,1:33:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star! Star! Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.60,1:33:48.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瞄准系统混乱）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.89,1:34:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么 - 卡友·里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Kyle Reese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.40,1:34:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.95,1:34:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.79,1:34:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.67,1:34:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Star, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.43,1:35:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,T-800\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-800s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.93,1:35:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.32,1:35:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.13,1:35:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 燃料电池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are these? - Fuel cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.70,1:35:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,T-800的能量源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life source for the T-800.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.04,1:36:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,核能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.37,1:36:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够把这儿炸平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to level this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.64,1:36:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.54,1:36:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.72,1:36:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.28,1:36:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.91,1:36:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Star, come on! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.25,1:36:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.02,1:36:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快啊 - 快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.02,1:37:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶到运输机那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get to the transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.60,1:37:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿 - 我得把这儿炸平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - I gotta end this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.70,1:37:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不能丢下你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm not gonna leave you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.60,1:37:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没有 - 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't. - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.37,1:37:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Connor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.13,1:38:48.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要目标：约翰·康纳）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.48,1:39:51.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（人类心脏 脆弱部位）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.16,1:39:59.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生命迹象：无 已被终结）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.44,1:40:08.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（跟踪：约翰·康纳）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.37,1:40:10.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（错误 位置：不明）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.16,1:40:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·康纳在里面 他还在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, John Connor's in there. He's still in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.80,1:40:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 她血容量低 给她输血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, she's hypovolemic, start a line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.90,1:40:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 约翰·康纳在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - John Connor's in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.61,1:40:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.83,1:40:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.20,1:40:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.93,1:41:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.70,1:41:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳 我是卡友 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor, it's Kyle! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.60,1:42:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你个狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.96,1:42:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.60,1:42:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.26,1:43:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.55,1:44:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.13,1:44:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.24,1:44:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能回基地了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't make it back to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.32,1:44:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最近的安全区域降落吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set this down in the nearest safe zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.08,1:44:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,救伤直升机 紧急情况 伤员胸口严重创伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medevac, urgent. Severe chest trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.65,1:44:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,联络手术小组 注意 是康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the surgical team. Remarks: it's Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.67,1:46:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能撑多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.91,1:46:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心脏…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.74,1:46:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.80,1:46:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的 不会有事的 凯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay. It's gonna be okay, Kate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.62,1:46:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.63,1:46:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.65,1:46:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.07,1:47:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.75,1:47:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.25,1:47:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.42,1:47:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都该有救赎的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody deserves a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.43,1:47:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.39,1:48:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么 让我们成为人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it that makes us human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.72,1:48:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是一种程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not something you can program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.89,1:48:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法写入芯片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't put it into a chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.33,1:48:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是人类心灵的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the strength of the human heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.67,1:48:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它 使我们区别于机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difference between us and machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.42,1:49:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雨就要到来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a storm on the horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.41,1:49:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又将是一个艰苦的时期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A time of hardship and pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.86,1:49:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打赢了这场战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This battle has been won, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.35,1:49:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但与机器的战争 仍在激烈进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the war against the machines rages on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.20,1:49:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网的全球网络依然强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skynet's global network remains strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.37,1:49:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不会放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will not quit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.11,1:49:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至将天网彻底摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until all of it is destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.38,1:49:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰·康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Connor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.88,1:49:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有命运 我们创造命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no fate but what we make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.20,1:49:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[谨以此片纪念斯坦·温斯顿]
